  ],
  "evidence_does_not_establish": [
    "Whether PULL_UP specifically acts as a true league-wide counter to PNR failure, demonstrating a causal lift.",
    "A robust methodology for isolating the causal effect of a specific counter-strategy from selection bias or regression to the mean.",
